(7007974, 1060431, 124982, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed, and well lit without the hotspots on the white sugar!</td>', 'Beautifully composed, and well lit without the hotspots on the white sugar!', '2013-03-27 18:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7007975, 1060719, 124982, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally sharp and well composed. Just lovely detail everywhere. The single strobe for lighting gives it the mood this kind of image needed.</td>', 'Exceptionally sharp and well composed. Just lovely detail everywhere. The single strobe for lighting gives it the mood this kind of image needed.', '2013-03-27 18:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7007977, 1059843, 124982, '<td valign="top">There is so much right with this one, the color of the coffee with the milk, the details in the sugar cubes, the lighting etc. Unfortunately, I find my eye is drawn always back to the the crumbs of sugar on the floor. If only those were swept up before shooting, this would''ve been so much cleaner and more punchier!</td>', 'There is so much right with this one, the color of the coffee with the milk, the details in the sugar cubes, the lighting etc. Unfortunately, I find my eye is drawn always back to the the crumbs of sugar on the floor. If only those were swept up before shooting, this would''ve been so much cleaner and more punchier!', '2013-03-27 18:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7007978, 1060425, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very classic and elegant. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very classic and elegant. Nicely done.', '2013-03-27 18:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7007981, 1060744, 124982, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a> perhaps? Lovely, warm, cosy lighting.</td>', ' Neat perhaps? Lovely, warm, cosy lighting.', '2013-03-27 18:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7007982, 1060519, 124982, '<td valign="top">I love almost absolutely everything about this image, from the hair to the details in the candy hat to the sugar cascade. Only two things that disrupt the image are the overly-smoothened skin and the weird purple haze between the models left eye and hairline. Her ear also has purple, but can''t tell if that is reflection from the hair or errant editing brushwork?</td>', 'I love almost absolutely everything about this image, from the hair to the details in the candy hat to the sugar cascade. Only two things that disrupt the image are the overly-smoothened skin and the weird purple haze between the models left eye and hairline. Her ear also has purple, but can''t tell if that is reflection from the hair or errant editing brushwork?', '2013-03-27 18:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7007985, 1059539, 124982, '<td valign="top">This is quite beautiful, perfectly lit and composed. Very sharp and crisp with great detail and gorgeous color. Guessing this is Olivers'' handiwork?</td>', 'This is quite beautiful, perfectly lit and composed. Very sharp and crisp with great detail and gorgeous color. Guessing this is Olivers'' handiwork?', '2013-03-27 18:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
