(7008063, 1060519, 129807, '<td valign="top">Leo? Is that you again?<br/>(not voting yet)...<br/>...(voted earlier)<br/>This will, obviously, take blue. The amount of work in the set up alone is incredible and of course the lighting is spot on - wouldn''t expect anything less from you Leo. But (and isn''t there always a ''but'') I really do not like the skin processing. For my tastes it is way too over-smoothed and detracts from an otherwise effective image. I am interested in whether this is your intention and personal preference, or did it just go too far? Excellent concept either way.</td>', 'Leo? Is that you again?(not voting yet)......(voted earlier)This will, obviously, take blue. The amount of work in the set up alone is incredible and of course the lighting is spot on - wouldn''t expect anything less from you Leo. But (and isn''t there always a ''but'') I really do not like the skin processing. For my tastes it is way too over-smoothed and detracts from an otherwise effective image. I am interested in whether this is your intention and personal preference, or did it just go too far? Excellent concept either way.', '2013-03-27 20:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
